        "text": "**BOONS OF THE BROOD**\n\nWeapons equipped by **HARLEQUINS MOUNTED** and **HARLEQUINS VEHICLE** models from your army have the **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]** ability.\n\nEach time a **HARLEQUINS** unit from your army disembarks from a **TRANSPORT**, until the end of the turn, that unit’s weapons have the **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]** ability.",
        "stats": {
          "Detachment Points": {
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
