      "Stratagem§Blades From Beyond": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Spirit Conclave"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WRAITHBLADES**, **WRAITHLORD** or **WRAITHKNIGHT** unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, melee weapons equipped by models in your unit have the **[DEVASTATING WOUNDS]** ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Blades of Asuryan": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Guardian Battlehost"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **Dire AVENGERS** or **GUARDIANS** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the **[PISTOL]** ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Blitzing Firepower": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Warhost"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ASURYANI** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]** ability while targeting an enemy unit within 12\". If such a weapon already has that ability, until the end of the phase, each time an attack is made with that weapon, an unmodified Hit roll of 5+ scores a Critical Hit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Bloody Dance": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Ghosts of the Webway"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **HARLEQUINS INFANTRY** or **HARLEQUINS MOUNTED** unit from your army that is within 6\" of one or more enemy units and would be eligible to declare a charge against one or more of those enemy units if it were your Charge phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit now declares a charge that only targets one or more of those enemy units, and you resolve that charge.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** Note that even if this charge is successful, your unit does not receive any Charge bonus this turn."
      },
      "Stratagem§Cloak and Shadow": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Corsair Coterie"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **AELDARI INFANTRY** unit from your army that is within range of an objective marker that you control and that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have the Stealth ability and your unit can only be selected as the target of a ranged attack if the attacking model is within 18\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Cost of Victory": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Guardian Battlehost"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **GUARDIANS** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** If your unit is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, remove it from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves. When doing so, return every destroyed **GUARDIANS** model to your unit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Crushing Strides": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Spirit Conclave"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Charge phase, just after a **WRAITHBLADES**, **WRAITHLORD** or **WRAITHKNIGHT** unit from your army ends a Charge move.\n\n**TARGET:** That **WRAITHBLADES**, **WRAITHLORD** or **WRAITHKNIGHT** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of your unit and roll one D6 for each **WRAITHBLADES** model in your unit, or roll four D6 if your unit has the **WRAITHLORD** keyword, or roll six D6 if your unit has the **WRAITHKNIGHT** keyword: for each 3+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound."
      },
      "Stratagem§Daring Riders": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Windrider Host"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** The Reinforcements step of your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ASURYANI MOUNTED** or **VYPER** unit from your army in Reserves.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, when setting up your unit on the battlefield from Reserves, it can be set up anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 6\" horizontally away from all enemy units. When doing so, if your unit is set up within 8\" horizontally of one or more enemy units, until the end of the turn, it is not eligible to declare a charge."
      },
      "Stratagem§Death Answers Death": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Devoted of Ynnead"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **YNNARI** unit from your army (excluding **WRAITH CONSTRUCT** units), if one or more models in that unit were destroyed this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can shoot as if it were your Shooting phase."
      },
      "Stratagem§Death From On High": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Windrider Host"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ASURYANI MOUNTED** or **VYPER** unit from your army that was set up on the battlefield from Reserves this turn and has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, you can re-roll the Wound roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Doom Inescapable": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Aspect Host"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **AVATAR OF KHAINE** model from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, your model’s Wailing Doom ranged weapon has a Range characteristic of 18\" and a Damage characteristic of 8."
      },
      "Stratagem§Emissaries of Ynnead": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Devoted of Ynnead"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just after a **YNNARI INFANTRY** unit from your army has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** That **YNNARI INFANTRY** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, re-roll a Hit roll of 1. If your unit is below its Starting Strength, you can re-roll the Hit roll instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§Exit The Stage": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Fateful Performance"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **unengaged** **HARLEQUINS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Place your unit in **strategic reserves**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Fangs of the Brood": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Serpent's Brood"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **TROUPE** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, when using your unit’s Dance of Death ability, you can select three of the abilities for your unit to gain, instead of one."
      },
      "Stratagem§Fate Inescapable": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Seer Council"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ASURYANI INFANTRY** unit from your army (excluding **WRAITH CONSTRUCT** units) that has not been selected to shoot this phase and is within 9\" of one or more friendly **ASURYANI PSYKER** models.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the **[IGNORES COVER]** ability and each time a model in your unit makes an attack, on a Critical Wound, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Feigned Retreat": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Warhost"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, just after an **ASURYANI** unit from your army Falls Back.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ASURYANI** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back."
      },
      "Stratagem§Fire and Fade": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Warhost"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, just after an **ASURYANI INFANTRY** unit from your army (excluding **AIRCRAFT**, **ASURMEN** and **WRAITH CONSTRUCT** units) has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ASURYANI** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a Normal move of up to D6+1\".\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** Until the end of the turn, your unit is not eligible to declare a charge or embark within a **TRANSPORT**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Focused Firepower": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Windrider Host"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ASURYANI MOUNTED** or **VYPER** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Forewarned": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Seer Council"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ASURYANI INFANTRY** unit from your army (excluding **WRAITH CONSTRUCT** units) that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks and is within 9\" of one or more friendly **ASURYANI PSYKER** models.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, subtract 1 from the Hit roll and subtract 1 from the Wound roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Heroes' Fall": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Fateful Performance"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly **HARLEQUINS** unit.\n\n**TARGET:** That **HARLEQUINS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** When a model in your unit is **destroyed**, if your unit has not been **selected to fight** this phase, roll one D6:\n\n- On a 4+, do not remove that model from the battlefield. When your unit has fought, or at the end of the phase (whichever comes first), that model is removed from the battlefield."
      },
      "Stratagem§Impeding Fire": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Eldritch Raiders"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your opponent’s Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **RANGERS**, **SHROUD RUNNERS** or **STARFANG** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit (excluding **TITANIC** units) visible to and within 36\" of your unit. Until the end of the phase, each time that enemy unit declares a charge, subtract 2 from the Charge roll (this is not cumulative with any other negative modifiers to that Charge roll)."
      },
      "Stratagem§Into the Breach": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Corsair Coterie"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, just after an **ANHRATHE** unit from your army destroyed one or more enemy units.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ANHRATHE** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** After your unit has resolved all of its shooting attacks, it can make a Normal move of up to D6+1\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Isha's Fury": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Seer Council"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ASURYANI PSYKER** model from your army within 9\" of that enemy unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Roll six D6: for each 3+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound."
      },
      "Stratagem§Khaine's Vengeance": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Aspect Host"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit (excluding **MONSTERS** and **VEHICLES**) is selected to Fall Back.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ASPECT WARRIORS** or **AVATAR OF KHAINE** unit from your army that is within Engagement Range of that enemy unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** All models in that enemy unit must take a Desperate Escape test. When doing so, if that enemy unit is Battle-shocked, subtract 1 from each of those tests."
      },
      "Stratagem§Layered Wards": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Armoured Warhost"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, when a friendly **AELDARI VEHICLE** unit suffers a **mortal wound**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **AELDARI VEHICLE** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit has **Feel No Pain 5+** against **mortal wounds**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Lethal Ruse": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Corsair Coterie"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, just after an **AELDARI** unit from your army Falls Back.\n\n**TARGET:** That **AELDARI** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back. If it is an **ANHRATHE** unit, also select one enemy unit your unit was within Engagement Range of at the start of the phase, and roll six D6: for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound."
      },
      "Stratagem§Lightning-fast Reactions": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Warhost"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
