          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, just after a **HARLEQUINS** unit from your army Falls Back.\n\n**TARGET:** That **HARLEQUINS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back."
      },
      "Stratagem§No Prey Too Big": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Eldritch Raiders"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ANHRATHE**, **RANGERS** or **SHROUD RUNNERS** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, if the Strength characteristic of that attack is less than the highest Toughness characteristic of models in the target unit, add 1 to the Wound roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Outcast Ambush": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Corsair Coterie"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **RANGERS** or **SHROUD RUNNERS** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the **[IGNORES COVER]** and **[RAPID FIRE 1]** abilities, and until the end of the phase, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of those weapons by 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Overflight": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Windrider Host"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your Shooting phase or the end of the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ASURYANI MOUNTED** unit from your army that destroyed one or more enemy units this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a Normal move of up to 7\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Pall of Dread": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Devoted of Ynnead"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **YNNARI** unit from your army that was just destroyed while it was within range of one or more objective markers you controlled at the end of the previous phase. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one of those objective markers. That objective marker remains under your control until your opponent’s Level of Control over that objective marker is greater than yours at the end of a phase."
      },
      "Stratagem§Parting The Veil": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Devoted of Ynnead"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
