          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ANHRATHE** unit from your army that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the start of the next Command phase, add 1 to the Objective Control characteristic of models in your unit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Ruthless Killers": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
