            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or Fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, add 1 to the Damage characteristic of that attack."
      },
      "Stratagem§Seer's Eye": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Spirit Conclave"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **AELDARI PSYKER** model from your army and one friendly **WRAITH CONSTRUCT** unit within 12\" of it that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit visible to your **PSYKER** model. Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your **WRAITH CONSTRUCT** unit makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, you can ignore any or all modifiers to the Armour Penetration and/or Damage characteristics of that attack."
      },
      "Stratagem§Shield Nodes": {
