          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **DIRE AVENGERS** or **GUARDIANS** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** If your unit is within range of one or more objective markers, until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, subtract 1 from the Wound roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Skyborne Sanctuary": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Aspect Host"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One unengaged **ASURYANI** unit from your army that was eligible to fight this phase and one friendly **TRANSPORT** it is able to embark within.\n\n**EFFECT:** If your **ASURYANI** unit is wholly within 6” of that **TRANSPORT**, it can embark within it."
      },
      "Stratagem§Skyward Lunge": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
