          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **AELDARI VEHICLE** unit is **selected to shoot**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **AELDARI VEHICLE** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s attacks can re-roll:\n\n- __One__ **hit roll**.\n\n- __One__ **wound roll**.\n\n- __One__ **damage roll**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Spiralling Evasion": {
