        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ASURYANI MOUNTED** or **VYPER** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have a 4+ invulnerable save."
      },
      "Stratagem§Spirit Token": {
