          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WRAITHBLADES** or **WRAITHGUARD** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one objective marker you control that your unit is within range of. That objective marker remains under your control until your opponent’s Level of Control over that objective marker is greater than yours at the end of a phase."
      },
      "Stratagem§Staged Death": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Ghosts of the Webway"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **HARLEQUINS CHARACTER** model from your army that was just destroyed. You can use this Stratagem on that model even though it was just destroyed.\n\n**EFFECT:** At the end of the phase, set your model back up on the battlefield as close as possible to where it was destroyed and not within Engagement Range of any enemy units, with half of its starting number of wounds remaining.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** Each model can only be targeted with this Stratagem once per battle."
      },
      "Stratagem§Striking Stride": {
