          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **HARLEQUINS** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, your unit is eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced."
      },
      "Stratagem§Time to Strike": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
