        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move.\n\n**TARGET:** One **TROUPE** unit from your army that is within 8\" of that enemy unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a Normal move of up to 6\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Unshrouded Truth": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Seer Council"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ASURYANI INFANTRY** unit from your army (excluding **WRAITH CONSTRUCT** units) that has not been selected to move this phase, was not set up on the battlefield this phase, and is within 9\" of one or more friendly **ASURYANI PSYKER** models.\n\n**EFFECT:** • Place your unit in **strategic reserves**.\n• Your unit has **Deep Strike**.\n• Your unit must make an **ingress move** this phase (including in your first turn).\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** Until the end of the phase, your unit is not eligible to be selected to move."
      },
      "Stratagem§Vaul's Vengeance": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Guardian Battlehost"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit destroys a **DIRE AVENGERS** or **GUARDIANS** unit from your army\n\n**TARGET:** One **WAR WALKERS** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** After that enemy unit has finished making its attacks, your unit can shoot as if it were your Shooting phase, but when resolving those attacks, it can only target that enemy unit (and only if it is an eligible target).\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You can only use this Stratagem once per battle round."
      },
      "Stratagem§Vectored Engines": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Armoured Warhost"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, when a friendly **AELDARI VEHICLE** unit makes a **fall-back move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **AELDARI VEHICLE** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** That move does not prevent your unit from being **eligible to shoot**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Vengeful Sorrow": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Corsair Coterie"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** One **AELDARI INFANTRY** unit from your army, if one or more models in that unit were destroyed as a result of those attacks, and if that **AELDARI** unit is neither Battle-shocked nor within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a surge move of up to D6+1\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Venomous Wrath": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Serpent's Brood"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **HARLEQUINS VEHICLE** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** After your unit has shot, if it is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, it can make a Normal move of up to 6\". Until the end of the turn, your unit is not eligible to declare a charge."
      },
      "Stratagem§Warding Salvoes": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Guardian Battlehost"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **DIRE AVENGERS** or **GUARDIANS** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets an enemy unit within range of one or more objective markers, you can re-roll the Wound roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Warrior Focus": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Aspect Host"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ASPECT WARRIORS** or **AVATAR OF KHAINE** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, you can ignore any or all modifiers to that attack’s Ballistic Skill, Weapon skill, Strength, Armour Penetration and Damage characteristics and/or any or all modifiers to the Hit roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Weaver’s Coils": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Serpent's Brood"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **HARLEQUINS MOUNTED** unit from your army that was eligible to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** If your unit is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, it can make a Normal move. Otherwise, your unit can make a Fall Back move of up to 6\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Weaving Stride": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Serpent's Brood"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move.\n\n**TARGET:** One **HARLEQUINS INFANTRY** unit from your army that is within 8\" of that enemy unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a Normal move of up to 6\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Webway Tunnel": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Warhost"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ASURYANI INFANTRY** unit from your army that is wholly within 9\" of one or more battlefield edges.\n\n**EFFECT:** If your unit is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, remove it from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves."
      },
      "Stratagem§Wind of Blades": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Windrider Host"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ASURYANI MOUNTED** or **VYPER** unit from your army that has not been selected to move this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced or Fell Back."
      },
      "Stratagem§Withdraw and Reinforce": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Eldritch Raiders"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ANHRATHE** unit from your army that is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Remove your unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves. If that unit is below Starting Strength, return all destroyed models (excluding **CHARACTER** models) to that unit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Wraithbone Armour": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Spirit Conclave"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WRAITH CONSTRUCT** unit from your army (excluding **TITANIC** units) that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time an attack is allocated to a model in your unit, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack."
      },
      "Stratagem§Yriel's Example": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Eldritch Raiders"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **AELDARI INFANTRY** unit from your army (excluding **WRAITH CONSTRUCT** units) that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have the Feel No Pain 5+ ability."
      },
