      "Stratagem§Deceptive Feint": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a move within 8\" of a friendly **unengaged** **HARLEQUINS INFANTRY** unit.\n\n**TARGET:** That **HARLEQUINS INFANTRY** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a **normal move** of up to D3+3\".",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Fateful Performance"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Phantasmal Mirage": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **HARLEQUINS VEHICLE** unit has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** That **HARLEQUINS VEHICLE** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** - Your unit can make a **normal move** of up to D6\".\n\n- Your unit is __not__ **eligible to declare a charge** until the end of the turn.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Twilight Flickers"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Presaged Rehearsal": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, when a friendly **TROUPE** unit is **selected to fight**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **TROUPE** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s melee attacks have **[LANCE]**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Twilight Flickers"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Captivating Performance": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **TROUPE** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one **objective** your unit is controlling. That **objective** is **secured**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Twilight Flickers"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Eldritch Suppression": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **RANGERS/SHROUD RUNNERS** unit has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** That **RANGERS/SHROUD RUNNERS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit hit by those ranged attacks. That enemy unit makes a **battle-shock roll**, with -1 to that **battle-shock roll** if a model in that enemy unit was **destroyed** by those attacks.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Path Of The Outcast"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Casting Back the Veil": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **RANGERS/SHROUD RUNNERS** unit has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** That **RANGERS/SHROUD RUNNERS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit hit by those ranged attacks. That enemy unit has +6\" **detection range**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Path Of The Outcast"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Nomads of the Hidden Way": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **RANGERS/SHROUD RUNNERS** unit has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** That **RANGERS/SHROUD RUNNERS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** - Your unit can make a **normal move** of up to D6\".\n\n- Your unit is __not__ **eligible to declare a charge** or embark within a **TRANSPORT** until the end of the turn.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Asuryani",
            "Path Of The Outcast"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Enhancement§Infamy (Aura)": {
        "text": "**ANHRATHE** unit only. While an enemy unit is within 3\" of this unit, subtract 1 from the Objective Control characteristic of models in that unit (to a minimum of 1).",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Corsair Coterie"
          ]
