      "Ability§Elemental Ensnarement": {
        "text": "At the end of your Fight phase, if this unit is not **battle-shocked**, you can use this ability. If you do, roll one D6:\n\n- On a 1, this unit is **battle-shocked**.\n\n- Select one **visible** enemy **MONSTER/VEHICLE** unit (excluding **TITANIC** units) within 18\" of this unit. That enemy unit is **ensnared** until the start of your next turn:\n\n- While a unit is **ensnared**, that unit has -2\" **M** and cannot be **pinned**."
      },
