      "Ability§Drakolithe": {
        "text": "_Once per battle, per token_\n\nWhen an enemy unit ends a move within 8\" of this unit, if this unit is unengaged or if that enemy unit ended that move **engaged** with this unit, you can use this ability. If you do, roll one D6:\n\n- On a 3+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound.\n\n_Place one Drakolithe token next to the unit for each Drakolithe the unit is equipped with, removing one each time this ability is used._"
      },
      "Model§Dragon Knight": {
        "stats": {
          "Ld": {
            "value": 7
          },
          "M": {
            "value": 10
          },
          "OC": {
